  "Storms can come late in the year.": "1243f476fa3e164d344a",
  "crowd": "dea311311d34f39c8f35",
  "There are fewer crowds in November.": "5cba119990c80692eda2",
  "affordable": "17c35a90aed12906b42e",
  "Hotels are more affordable then.": "4a280aedc7c6976ff59c",
  "Not at all. Early-season showers usually last only an hour or two, so they rarely disrupt your plans.": "56d99bf264ad6b3a9a5e",
  "But isn’t November very wet?": "d9acc1adbbcd0b7e5867",
  "It is one of the wettest months, and storms can come late in the year. However, it is the off-season, so the old town is quiet and hotels are more affordable. For beaches and festivals, I’d suggest March to August instead.": "07c22c64741a2ce2a13a",
  "That helps me decide. Thanks!": "8f4a308a9ffcb1b9d8b7",
