  "The sauce gives balance to the roll.": "fd5e08a9e97a00be0224",
  "basil": "4adb3ff80fb958f9f943",
  "Add some Vietnamese basil.": "5ca88687a39435625c9c",
  "It is all about contrast. The pork is cut so that each slice keeps skin at both ends, which gives every bite a different texture.": "ddf6e23d709080de9111",
  "Interesting. And the vegetables?": "55eeb941598308dcec1c",
  "Green banana adds an astringent note, cucumber adds sweetness, and the anchovy dip ties everything together with spicy, sour and slightly sweet flavours.": "22c87d769e35a97b3160",
  "It sounds perfectly balanced. Thank you!": "6c82c265e1703c5d0173",
  "Hi, I’m Henry. I study architecture. Which buildings here show different influences?": "f0143010693e9c1a7ffc",
