  "The bridge has a wooden frame.": "fde2ac411f8f04891c13",
  "architect": "468a9b9c209274bfacbb",
  "A French architect designed it.": "8259cee6d97dfadd6029",
  "storey": "5e220a42e4688ad47fcf",
  "It has a three-storey central block.": "bbf4a922b923e6036cd3",
  "Da Nang Museum is a good example. A French architect designed it in the Neoclassical style, and it opened in 1900.": "aecdc3338a7ef4a5ffb6",
  "And something more Asian?": "9e974c5e8111e44bc067",
  "The Japanese Covered Bridge in Hoi An. It has a “house above, bridge below” design with yin-yang tiles, so you can see Vietnamese, Japanese and Chinese influences together.": "370f72af244e76cb59d7",
  "Two great examples. Thank you!": "e705ed6d3073a3cc4d1a",
