  "host": "db9348f9b0d20187973f",
  "Trung Vuong Theatre hosts concerts.": "3e8ac26aec3e38075928",
  "I’d recommend the Nguyen Hien Dinh Tuong Theatre. Tuong from the Quang region is national intangible heritage.": "56ebcff1e4aa3bbf581d",
  "What other venues are there?": "887ed46462d853141c5d",
  "Trung Vuong Theatre hosts many festivals of song, dance and music, and the General Science Library has a big reading room. The area around the administrative centre is becoming a cultural space too.": "d99defd612507a5609f4",
  "Wonderful, I’ll check what’s on. Thanks!": "e58eec1bb03564a9f84c",
  "Good afternoon, I’m Martin. I keep hearing that Da Nang is a “gateway”. What makes its location so important?": "9d422b7990726eb60db1",
  "strategic": "ca91841f58aa5baa8b2b",
  "Da Nang has a strategic location.": "bf7aed81bd571d7ebbe1",
  "corridor": "e5faa0b21c053774be8e",
  "The East–West Economic Corridor ends here.": "2d4aa11174a3e994e4b9",
  "transit": "1ae4c68c531d153b3290",
  "It is a transit gateway for Laos.": "e408b924dd948c603429",
  "hub": "c8f8e137ae50eaff842d",
  "The city is a regional trade hub.": "b79983cc705e2f5f4515",
  "landlocked": "24c4eb271ecab1759236",
  "Laos is a landlocked country.": "8c9bfcdb7bc240a8d5a4",
  "connectivity": "97807333380240ec1f41",
  "Good connectivity attracts trade.": "5536cb194ddaafc7ab6f",
  "gateway": "cdb049da632574019485",
  "Da Nang is a gateway to the sea.": "fcb828a080a935c6d166",
  "complement": "e002b824f14fe82bf691",
  "It complements Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City.": "b066e4be80f6edfde96e",
  "deep-water port": "2eabe41fbf252d118140",
  "Tien Sa is a deep-water port.": "11985c8252f5a2e52123",
  "axis": "cc92908fe630aec276d0",
  "It sits on the north–south axis.": "3cb1457ae3e070e3dbf3",
  "It sits right at the midpoint of the country, on the north–south road, rail, sea and air routes, and Da Nang Bay offers deep, safe water for large ships.": "13644f9b249a67023323",
  "Is it only about Vietnam, though?": "4f6338fb46c469ae5927",
  "Not at all. It is the end point of the East–West Economic Corridor, so it is a transit gateway for landlocked Laos and an alternative route to the sea for Thailand and Myanmar. That is why it complements Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City.": "114b31a47b960ae9f67d",
  "A convincing case. Thank you!": "aaf1b8f8b26e6ee87d4d",
  "Hello, I’m Amara. I’m curious how Da Nang protects its nature while it grows so fast.": "adf71dde789e65ae63e0",
  "ecosystem": "7ebd387615822658078d",
  "Son Tra has a rich ecosystem.": "2966d250c1e8e2c4b8ad",
