  "sustainable": "8e0fb972120e9264fa21",
  "Tourism must be sustainable.": "b20b9172e6a9560dfe7e",
  "terrain": "21d4fa6c97e3f990b57c",
  "The terrain runs from coast to mountains.": "9fcf95bb53727da4bde1",
  "impact": "0f2be4dfd493c27b2ee8",
  "Fast growth has an impact on nature.": "c58295f853a85a9c6fbe",
  "peninsula": "ab6d40ce3e6ff7908999",
  "Son Tra is a green peninsula.": "60e4a37c0e3f82120ec4",
  "wastewater": "d20417264c86b1ebd8b0",
  "Wastewater treatment needs to improve.": "c89138db88d030d7ae76",
  "landscape": "bfcd5bea1a679cf742ff",
  "The plan preserves the landscape.": "10f45ba6e2e0271b986f",
  "ecotourism": "617cac9f9f71e94f4729",
  "Son Tra is planned for ecotourism.": "a9135df40d9a1e765962",
  "The key place is the Son Tra Peninsula. The plan is to develop it as ecotourism linked to conservation and biodiversity.": "09538d6e5ea9b37f15fb",
  "Are there real challenges, though?": "91ef35f184ef5c36f7e7",
  "Yes. Wastewater collection and treatment on the coast is still insufficient, so fast growth has an impact. Sustainable development means protecting the landscape while the city stretches from the coast to the western mountains.": "3615fb563994c0a4f1f8",
  "A balanced view. Thank you!": "95d231bce0ef8fa901e5",
  "Good evening, I’m Sebastian. I write about food and place. What does a dish like mì Quảng say about this region?": "bfefc8c000bc17f06f60",
  "terroir": "13bd98f319cf03a483d4",
  "You can taste the terroir of the coast.": "4d7bdf280144beed075f",
