  "Mì Quảng is part of our culinary heritage.": "9e9c404246cf1f2e86f0",
  "shared identity": "766327cb017a2b5a5224",
  "The dish shows a shared identity.": "ba0e32f000b0167fb292",
  "adaptation": "26e86c0239d8434a5e4e",
  "The broth is an adaptation to local ingredients.": "8b6a4c8a80d5ab1178e9",
  "locally sourced": "cd33be115f9967f93074",
  "The ingredients are locally sourced.": "b383aee41606d7b88714",
  "essential": "61fcc8d6f5fb5aee6bf6",
  "The sauce is essential to the dish.": "375878ada95a43fe6a98",
  "nuttiness": "0bbf8daaad614180f496",
  "Peanuts add nuttiness.": "823a1728541e81a5c197",
  "livestock": "af8b42e38d16c1e2a612",
  "The broth can use livestock or poultry.": "398bcf957871ef03c8eb",
  "region": "f8a6bb8180d9bb7243f2",
  "Food tells the story of a region.": "306ec4877544a799febc",
  "It tells you that Quang Nam and Da Nang share one food culture. They were one province until 1997, merged again in 2025, and the dish belongs to both.": "a7f0bbbf2e8f86a6cce1",
  "And what about the ingredients?": "b6fb837a6d8c3235b782",
  "The broth is locally sourced from whatever seafood, meat or poultry is available, and fermented anchovy sauce runs through the local dishes. So the terroir of this coast is literally in the bowl.": "6320fecc632c1ea74a43",
  "Beautifully put. Thank you!": "3a32561c636a71e9dbd3",
